      <div class="copy">
        <p class="large">You don't have to be a confident speaker before you join. Toastmasters gives you a supportive environment to practise, learn from others and improve one step at a time.</p>
        <p>At Avon Toastmasters, members take part in prepared speeches, impromptu speaking, meeting roles and constructive evaluations. You can build skills useful for workplace presentations, study, community involvement and everyday conversations.</p>
        <p>There is no requirement to speak when you first visit. Come along, observe a meeting and decide whether the club feels right for you.</p>
